  "body": "## Goal\n\nServe Kimi K3.1 on Ascend NPUs with SGLang.\n\nKimi K3.1 is a hybrid-attention MoE model: 69 KDA (linear attention) layers + 24 full-attention layers with DSA sparse attention (`index_topk=2048`), mxfp4-quantized routed experts. The remote-code checkpoint requires DSA to be routed correctly through the hybrid backend/pool wrappers on NPU.\n\n## Status\n\n- Implementation PR: #48420\n- Verified topology: 3 nodes × 8 cards, TP8 × PP3\n- Accuracy: single-request (prefill + decode) verified on this topology; throughput benchmarks to be added\n\n## Docker images (CANN 9.1.0)\n\n- `swr.cn-southwest-2.myhuaweicloud.com/base_image/dockerhub/lmsysorg/sglang:cann9.1.0-950-kimi-k3.1`\n- `swr.cn-southwest-2.myhuaweicloud.com/base_image/dockerhub/lmsysorg/sglang:cann9.1.0-a3-kimi-k3.1`\n\n## Discussion\n\nQuestions and feedback on the NPU adaptation are welcome here. Code review should go to #48420.",
